  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=c20045&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构预览\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_overview.webp\" alt=\"概览\"></p><p>本模组支持 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！同时支持仅服务端安装。1.20.4 版本后不再支持 Forge。</p><h3>关于</h3><p>Moogs Nether Structures 为 Minecraft 的下界维度增添了新颖且激动人心的建筑结构。探索过程中，你将发现宝藏、遭遇强敌，并体验趣味挑战。该模组可独立运行，也可与我们主打的结构模组 MVS 配合使用，完美适配任何整合包，同时保持原版游戏风格。跃入下界，开启你的探索之旅吧！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以3D形式浏览所有结构\"></a></p><p>点击此处查看我们的主打结构模组 MVS：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MVS</a>。</p><h3>配置包</h3><p>模组的每个方面均可通过数据包进行自定义。包含完整说明的模板可在此处获取：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mns-moogs-nether-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置包</a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_features.webp\" alt=\"特色\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/RH0cIuq.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p><h3>视频</h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kVKuCqDgfsY?si=IN54-VglgPArp0d-?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wlzgAujeqFY?si=3V3KSkn-BeHOrrIY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>整合包</h3><p>查看所有整合包请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d55402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合包索引</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_discord.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p>获取回复最快的方式是加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH赞助\"></a></p>",
